# Environment Configuration

Copy this file to `.env` and update values for your environment.

## Development Environment
```
ENV=development
DEBUG=true

# API Configuration
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000
API_WORKERS=1
API_TIMEOUT=30

# Database
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=3306
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=password
DB_NAME=safety_ai
```

## Production Environment
```
ENV=production
DEBUG=false

# API Configuration
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000
API_WORKERS=4
API_TIMEOUT=30

# Database
DB_HOST=your-db-server.com
DB_PORT=3306
DB_USER=production_user
DB_PASSWORD=strong_password_here
DB_NAME=safety_ai_prod

# Security (REQUIRED)
SECRET_KEY=your-very-long-random-secret-key-change-this
JWT_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60

# CORS
CORS_ORIGINS=https://yourdomain.com,https://app.yourdomain.com

# Logging
LOG_LEVEL=WARNING
LOG_FORMAT=json

# Rate Limiting
RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=true
RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS=100
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW=60

# Email Alerts
ALERT_EMAIL_ENABLED=true
SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=alerts@yourdomain.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=app-specific-password
SMTP_FROM=Safety Alerts <alerts@yourdomain.com>

# Webhook Alerts
ALERT_WEBHOOK_ENABLED=true
ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-webhook-endpoint.com/alerts
```

## Configuration Variables

### Environment
- `ENV`: Application environment (development/testing/production)
- `DEBUG`: Debug mode enabled/disabled

### API
- `API_HOST`: Host to bind to
- `API_PORT`: Port to listen on
- `API_WORKERS`: Number of worker processes (for gunicorn)
- `API_TIMEOUT`: Request timeout in seconds

### Database
- `DB_HOST`: MySQL server host
- `DB_PORT`: MySQL server port
- `DB_USER`: Database user
- `DB_PASSWORD`: Database password
- `DB_NAME`: Database name
- `DB_POOL_SIZE`: Connection pool size
- `DB_MAX_OVERFLOW`: Max overflow connections
- `DB_POOL_RECYCLE`: Connection recycle time

### Security
- `SECRET_KEY`: Secret key for JWT tokens (generate with: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))")
- `JWT_ALGORITHM`: JWT algorithm (default: HS256)
- `JWT_EXPIRE_MINUTES`: Token expiration time

### CORS
- `CORS_ORIGINS`: Comma-separated list of allowed origins
- `CORS_CREDENTIALS`: Allow credentials
- `CORS_METHODS`: Allowed HTTP methods
- `CORS_HEADERS`: Allowed headers

### Logging
- `LOG_LEVEL`: Logging level (DEBUG/INFO/WARNING/ERROR/CRITICAL)
- `LOG_DIR`: Log file directory
- `LOG_FORMAT`: Log format (json/text)

### AI Model
- `MODEL_PATH`: Path to YOLOv8 model
- `MODEL_CONFIDENCE`: Model confidence threshold
- `MODEL_IOU`: Model IOU threshold

### MediaMTX Configuration
- `APP_PORT`: FastAPI backend port (default: 8002)
- `CAMERA_RTSP_URL`: Direct RTSP URL from camera (default: rtsp://192.168.1.71:554/12)
- `MEDIAMTX_RTSP_URL`: MediaMTX proxied RTSP URL (default: rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/sitecam)
- `MEDIAMTX_WEBRTC_URL`: MediaMTX WebRTC URL for frontend (default: http://127.0.0.1:8889/sitecam/)
- `MEDIAMTX_HLS_URL`: MediaMTX HLS URL for frontend (default: http://127.0.0.1:8888/sitecam/index.m3u8)

### AI Worker Configuration
- `AI_ENABLED`: Enable AI background worker (default: true)
- `AI_FRAME_SKIP`: Process every Nth frame (default: 10)
- `AI_RESIZE_WIDTH`: Frame resize width for AI (default: 640)
- `AI_RESIZE_HEIGHT`: Frame resize height for AI (default: 360)
- `AI_RECONNECT_DELAY_SEC`: Reconnect delay on stream failure (default: 1.0)

### File Upload
- `MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE`: Maximum upload size in bytes
- `UPLOAD_DIR`: Upload directory
- `ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS`: Allowed file extensions

### Rate Limiting
- `RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED`: Enable rate limiting
- `RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS`: Max requests per window
- `RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW`: Time window in seconds

### Alerts
- `ALERT_ENABLED`: Enable alerts
- `ALERT_EMAIL_ENABLED`: Enable email alerts
- `ALERT_WEBHOOK_ENABLED`: Enable webhook alerts
- `ALERT_THRESHOLD`: Alert severity threshold
- `SMTP_SERVER`: SMTP server address
- `SMTP_PORT`: SMTP port
- `SMTP_USER`: SMTP user
- `SMTP_PASSWORD`: SMTP password
- `ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL`: Webhook URL for alerts
